@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5225
@username = octocat

### Profile
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/github/user/{{username}}
Accept: application/json

### Repositories
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/github/user/{{username}}/repos
Accept: application/json

### Language breakdown
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/github/user/{{username}}/languages
Accept: application/json

### Activity in the last 30 days
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/github/user/{{username}}/activity
Accept: application/json

### Remaining GitHub quota (free to call)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/github/rate-limit
Accept: application/json

### Health
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/health
